WEBVTT

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.370
A powerful Kekkai technique user,

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.670
Masamori is Yoshimori's older brother
by seven years...

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.500
and is disliked by Yoshimori.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.670
What is Masamori's true intention
for visiting Karasumori?

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.440
And who is this mysterious figure?

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:27.420
Yoshimori swore that he would seal
the Karasumori Site forever.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:32.250
That way, neither you nor anybody else...
will ever get hurt.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:37.770
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.630
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:44.840
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.740
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.180
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:54.580
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:58.120
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.460
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:07.120
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:11.630
Sha la la la la...

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:18.040
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.010
(Secret romance)

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:25.210
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.980
(A strange distance)

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:33.820
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:34.890
Yeah

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.360
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.960
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:47.300
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.920
All right! It's done!

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.480
Let's see. I need a plate.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:15.690
Nevertheless, why do we only have
this kind of tableware?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.600
Whoops!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.100
This is bad!
It's Grandpa Shige's valuable teacup!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.250
I know!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.310
This is what the Hazama-Style
Restoration Technique is for.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:34.910
Shiki!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:40.280
I'm counting on you!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.150
Arrrghh!

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.550
Ow! What was that for?!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.820
You fool! Did you forget
what I always tell you?!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.170
You're not allowed to
use the Restoration Technique

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.370
outside of Karasumori!

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.170
Should be okay, right?
It's only a little bit!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.330
No, you fool!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.650
Besides, you can only be
called a good Caster

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.770
if you don't rely on your Shikigami!

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:10.910
You mean the Full Restoration
technique? I can do that!

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:17.820
I said don't use it
outside of Karasumori!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:23.060
You fool! You're so easy
to manipulate.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.500
That's my favorite teacup...

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.830
You just noticed now?!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.740
Why, you little!

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.740
Oh no, you don't!

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:37.880
We'll finish this once and for all!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.980
You little brat! I'll discipline you!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.680
The weather is so nice today...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.630
D-Don't worry don't worry!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.100
Because if anything happens
Sumimura-kun will help me!

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.580
This brings back many memories...

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.690
You know that math teacher.
"Xavier" Ito? He's seriously terrible!

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:21.980
Really?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:27.160
Seriously! I don't know
how to put it, but he's...

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.100
Hey! My curry bun!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.920
What about your curry bun?

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.690
It disappeared!

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.170
Are you sure you didn't just eat it?

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.890
I couldn't have!

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.630
- Wow!
- Wow!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.680
Mao-san, your lunch boxes always
look so delicious!

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.610
Your fried chicken today looks
especially wonderful!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.110
Of course!

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:49.210
The special Hinai chickens from
the Shinohara family-owned farms are...

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:52.840
It's gone! My fried chicken!

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.220
Did somebody eat it?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.390
My fried chicken!

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.660
My fried shrimp?!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.790
- My omelet!
- My jumbo cream bun!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.730
Hey auntie, are there any
fried noodle buns left?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.400
If you don't see it,
then we're out. Look carefully.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.440
Hey! There it is!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.040
Yeah! I found it!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:22.850
Wait? What the-?
Huh? No way!

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:36.700
I swear it was in my hand
a moment ago...

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.330
That was fast!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.040
What happened?

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.310
I remembered I had to do something!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:47.670
Sorry! I'm going ahead!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:48.640
Tokine!

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.190
I'm so sorry!

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.410
N-No problem at all!

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.180
Excuse me!

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:02.020
Cute!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:06.360
You're so lucky! I want Yukimura-san
to bump into me, too!

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.390
I lost sight of it.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.570
That's odd...
If it was an Ayakashi

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.630
I would have noticed
when it entered the school grounds.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:21.910
Sumimura, what's wrong?

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.850
Lunchtime is usually the only time

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.240
you're restored to life.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:32.280
I'm so sleepy...
I guess I'll be taking a nap.

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:37.290
What's wrong?

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:40.120
It disappeared?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.820
Or was it something else?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.430
Oh well. I didn't feel
any Negative Energy anyway.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.500
No problems within the high school...

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:01.570
I want to check the middle school
but I don't want to depend on him.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.150
Maybe I should use a Shiki.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:10.160
I knew it!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.060
You're Sumimura-kun's older sister!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:12.750
Excuse me?!

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:16.830
My name is Kanda Yurina
and I'm Sumimura-kun's classmate!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:19.590
Oh! She's the girl from
the cherry blossom incident.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:23.040
I didn't know you went
to high school here!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.440
Did you need something
from the junior high school?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.070
Uh... no...

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.680
You must be looking
for Sumimura-kun!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.000
Should I go get him?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.540
It's not that.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.270
Wait... You have spiritual powers, right?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.650
Did you see anything strange?

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.620
Yes... I did.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:41.680
Really?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:46.160
Yes, it was a big, round person
in a kimono.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.550
That's it!

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:48.890
Where did you see it?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:51.530
All right, I'll take you there!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.030
It was over here!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.540
Sumimura-kun's sister...

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.800
Um, you're able to terminate
weird things too if they're here, right?

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.140
Um... Yes.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.050
But wait... I'm not his sister...

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.810
That's a relief.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:11.980
It seems she's misunderstood.
But he is like a brother to me...

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.720
It was on top of that wall!

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.420
It's moss.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.030
So he was standing where
that moss is growing now?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.330
Yes.

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.660
Is that moss safe to touch?

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.300
I don't feel any Negative Energy.
It should be all right.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.240
I should track it down
with the moss.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.670
Excuse me. Mr. Kurosu.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.410
Did you eat all of these snacks?

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.520
M-Mold?!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.020
No. This is moss...

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:53.190
Speaking of which,
this was my dessert for today...

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.090
one dozen of my strawberry
mochi sweets just disappeared.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.100
One dozen strawberry mochi sweets?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.760
You were going to
eat them all yourself?!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.870
Huh? You're surprised at that more?

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.880
It's that guy from back there...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.390
I don't feel any Negative Energy
coming from it

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:20.750
so it's not an Ayakashi...

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.850
But those are... donuts?

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:26.750
Insolent fool!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.730
Don't touch Lord Uro. Kid!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.230
I am a servant of Lord Uro. Mamezo!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:39.500
Listen. Lord Uro is not someone
you can easily get close to...

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:49.240
Lord Uro! Lord Uro! Lord Uro!

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.220
Oh? Mamezo?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.810
I am right here.

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:56.220
Now Mamezo, you really should not
enter my mouth.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:57.280
You know that.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.490
No. I...

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:06.660
You don't look like a bad guy
so let me tell you something.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.730
Get out of here now!

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.270
If not, I'll have to terminate you!

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.230
Ketsu!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:15.940
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.680
Damn! I overslept!

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.700
You're still here?

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:40.090
You're finally awake, kid!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.430
How did you get inside
my Kekkai?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.700
Lord Uro is looking for a Kekkaishi!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:47.730
What?

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:51.870
Lord Uro! Welcome!

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.400
Now now! Please help yourself!

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.040
This is quite a feast we have.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.180
Is this guy that important?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.750
How dare you call
Lord Uro "this guy"?!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.820
Father. I made all this.
As you said,

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.630
but don't you think
it is a bit much?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:14.330
Oh, Shuji-san.
Can you please keep it coming?

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.160
Lord Uro seems very hungry.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.370
Seems?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:23.010
Oh, right. Dad can't see spirits.

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.610
Lord Uro is right there.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.810
I-It disappeared!

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:32.450
I-It's there!
Something is there!

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:35.060
I understand! I'll go make more!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.590
Thank you.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.120
By the way, Lord Uro.

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:44.630
Since you have reappeared,
does that mean?

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.570
I wasn't able to find it
in the end.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.500
I wonder what that thing was.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:55.400
That's probably Lord Uro.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.470
You know about it. Grandma?!

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:03.380
Consider him a kind of deity
that presides over nature.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:04.680
A deity?!

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.080
This happened once about fifty years ago.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:12.250
I wonder if Lord Uro's bed has broken again?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:18.330
Lord Uro is like a guardian deity
of this area

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.300
and he normally resides
the Colorless Marsh

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.360
in the outskirts of
the neighboring city.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:29.370
But sometimes. The condition
of his bed deteriorates

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:34.280
and we Kekkaishi of Karasumori have
the duty of fixing it for him.

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.620
I did it once
fifty years ago.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:39.510
This time it is your turn.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:43.620
Me? What does it mean
to fix his bed anyway?

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.360
It is the sacred bed of a deity.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.450
You must put all of
your heart into this.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:50.660
What about the... Yukimuras?

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.960
We don't need the help
of the Yukimuras.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:56.400
This will be done
tomorrow morning.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:59.630
Do not offend him
while he is here.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:02.940
The wrath of Lord Uro
is the wrath of a deity.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:08.610
That Grandpa Shige...

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.580
He's always deciding things on his own.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:13.720
But still...

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.480
Why is he here?

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:18.720
And why is he staring at me?

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.700
All right.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.260
I'll make anything you want,
so choose from here.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.130
Oh? Really?

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:33.970
Yeah.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.940
I don't mind having
other people eat what I make.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.850
Then again,
you're not "people."

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:46.710
Hm? Donuts?

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.010
You want this?

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:51.290
Come to think of it.

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:52.990
You were eating donuts
during the day too.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.760
Donuts!

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.290
All right!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.860
I'll make you as many as you want!

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:05.730
Okay! Eat up!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:12.470
Are they good?

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:13.840
They're okay.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:20.990
Still... How is it that
a deity loves donuts?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.520
Wait!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.530
You're the guardian deity
of this area, right?

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.720
You should know
a lot about the Karasumori Site.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.060
And about its powers?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.730
Kid! Stop it right there!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.870
You're taking too many liberties
with Lord Uro!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.430
Do you want some too?

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:39.470
I don't eat things like that!

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.300
Don't say it like that.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.740
Your master seems
to like it a lot.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.250
What is this guy doing?

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.020
A long time ago,

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:04.730
there was a dark...
deep, deep forest here...

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.230
You're answering me now?!

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:13.300
It was indeed...
a very dark and deep... forest...

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.140
and I was in the middle of it...

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:22.870
A dark, quiet, yet peaceful place.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:27.250
One day, a human came to me...

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:31.460
Would you please
turn this land over to me?

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.120
I require the power of this land.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:41.040
I said no. But that human
provided me with a better place,

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.130
so I gave him the center.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:46.340
Oh, how it brings back
many memories.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:50.000
Wait! Wasn't Karasumori
the name of the lord?

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.880
And when Hazama Tokimori sealed

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:57.410
the soul of the lord... isn't that
what Karasumori is?!

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.210
What is that forest you're talking about?!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.690
Don't fall asleep!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.690
Hey! Lord Uro is tired!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.290
Stand back. Kid!

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.900
What's going on?

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:20.140
A long time ago...

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:23.580
There was a dark...
deep deep forest here...

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:27.910
And that's supposed to
be Karasumori?

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:31.210
What are you thinking about?

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:34.290
What?

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.790
That human that he talked about...

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:42.390
Since it's the Kekkaishi's duty
to fix Lord Uro's bed...

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.550
That means it's either ours
or Yukimura's ancestor.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.530
Could it be the founder
Hazama Tokimori?

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.430
But in that case...

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:56.070
Plagued by Ayakashi the lord of Karasumori
called upon Hazama Tokimori

00:16:56.110 --> 00:17:00.880
who was a specialist
in demon extermination.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.680
I require the power of this land.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.750
Why did he need it?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.690
Or rather what is
the power of this land?

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:15.720
I don't get it!
I'm not good at thinking!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.060
But I think...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.090
the story that I've been told all along

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.330
contains all kinds of lies.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:25.940
Yoshimori!

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.480
Is Lord Uro with you guys?

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.300
Yeah. Do you know about him?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.940
I knew it. Did his bed break?

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:37.680
Uh... Yeah...

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:42.210
I heard Grandma went to
fix it back in her day.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:45.190
Huh? My Grandpa said
he went to fix it. Too.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:49.460
Really? Maybe they went together.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:50.890
That's strange.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.530
He said we don't need
the Yukimuras' help.

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.070
Anyway, when are you going?

00:17:56.540 --> 00:18:00.170
Grandma said that we should let
the Sumimuras do it this time.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.710
But since it's a tradition, I'll help.

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:04.440
No, that's all right.

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:08.000
I have other stuff
I need to ask him.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:09.570
But still...

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.620
I don't want to get
Tokine involved with this.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.530
It seems like it's not supposed
to be difficult.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.930
So I'll do it alone.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.550
You take a break.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.460
But...

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.400
Don't worry about it.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.330
That's kinda odd...

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:38.210
We're off! To Colorless Marsh!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:41.720
Wait. Why are you fully equipped?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.080
It's still light outside!

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:45.350
This is what I wear when
I undertake traditional duties!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.220
At least put away the Tenketsu!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:53.220
Quiet! And what about you?
What's with your shabby appearance?!

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.560
What?

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:57.420
No one gets away with making fun
of my windbreakers!

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.570
Get away with what?! You fool!

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:02.570
That's it, you senile old bat!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:05.600
Who're you calling senile! You runt!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:06.900
It's on now!

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.500
Hey... You two...

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.280
- I won't take this sitting down!
- We must hurry...

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.110
I'll beat some sense into you!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.270
Enough already!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.780
Fine, I'll go change into jeans.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.520
I'll put the Tenketsu in a bag.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:24.480
I'll explain what to do,

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.620
but you will have to
complete the rest yourself.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:28.820
That's fine.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.660
All right! I'll ask him
questions then!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.970
Mommy, what's with that old man?

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:43.210
We're filming a historical drama!

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:46.710
See?! I told you not to dress like that!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:50.310
You're inexperienced and
don't take pride in your work!

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:52.110
I'm okay with being inexperienced!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.120
You snot-faced brat!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:55.380
Stop it, I say!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.460
We are in the domain of Lord Uro!

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:12.700
We're close.

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:40.660
Hey! What's that hole?

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:43.770
He's parting the water for us.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.370
I have to go in there too?

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:58.710
Yes.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.680
Just be sure to be very careful.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:09.550
I wonder if Yoshimori is okay.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.390
Ah yes, I wonder if he'll be able to
come back alive.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:14.620
What?

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.730
I've already explained everything
you need to do.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.310
I'll stay behind to
be your anchor.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:23.840
Make it quick.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.550
I wonder if I'll...

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:34.480
...have to keep doing stuff like
leaping into holes like this

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.920
...over and over again?

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.220
What's wrong?!
Are you scared?

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.120
Then I'll jump in as
many times as I have to!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:05.540
What am I doing?

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:08.980
I know...

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:14.360
I jumped into that...
huge hole in the marsh...

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:19.520
That means I'm still
falling down the hole?

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:22.900
This feels weird...

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:28.570
What could be waiting
for me ahead?

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:33.110
What's going to happen to me?

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:52.390
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:56.800
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:01.100
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:05.540
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:18.020
I feel like I could fly
For the one I love

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:26.760
Even if I search the whole world
No one could replace you

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:31.600
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:40.210
Don't cry

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.950
Even if I search the whole world
No one could replace you

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:53.790
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.830 --> 00:24:02.200
Don't cry
